  <revision rev="5" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>8f0f53a4087a4ccb8b00afab2d628a48</srcmd5>
    <version>3.0.0</version>
    <time>1795103757</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to version 3.0.0:
  * Highlights:
    + Weather overview: a one-line summary of the coming hours, such as when
      rain starts, under the current conditions. It can be turned off in
      Preferences.
    + Overview notifications: the overview arrives as a desktop notification
      while the window is minimized or in compact mode. It replaces the old
      notification on every refresh.
    + Run in background: new option to keep Mousam running when its window is
      closed.
    + Icons: choose between the default and Material weather icons.
  * Design:
    + Redesigned top section, gauges, bars and air quality graph.
    + The sunrise card draws the sun's path through the day and shows the moon
      phase and twilight.
    + The weekly forecast shows temperature ranges, the chance of rain as drops
      and snow as snowflakes. The tomorrow list shows how heavy the rain will
      be.
    + Air quality details open in a dialog, with the main pollutant and health
      advice.
    + Preferences regrouped into a dialog. The About dialog shows release notes
      and troubleshooting info.
  * Locations and compact mode:
    + Saved locations show their current weather and local time. You can
      reorder them by drag or with Alt+Up and Alt+Down.
    + Faster city search that no longer freezes the window, with a Retry button
      when it fails.
    + Compact mode spells out its details, can be left with Esc and offers
      Retry after an error.
  * Fixes:
    + Pressure is now sea-level pressure, so high places no longer always read
      &quot;Low&quot;.
    + Fixed 100% CPU use and memory growth on refresh.
    + Fixed hourly tiles cut off by the scrollbar.
    + Fixed old units showing right after switching between metric and
      imperial.
    + Feat(ui-forecast): remove bottom margin on forecast GtkBox
    + Added pt_PT translation
    + Fix Wind/Precipitation and Weekly tabs silently failing due to
      weak_connect() GC bug
    + Update pt_BR.po
    + Enhance UI and refactor architecture for improved performance
    + Improve rain icon contrast
    + Update POT and PO files
    + Fixes and translations in Spanish strings
    + Portuguese (Portugal) translation update
    + Fix: fix and complete Spanish (es_ES) translations
    + Feat/add catalan translations
    + Fix: round pressure in compact mode
    + Fix: refresh saved locations without PreferencesGroup.get_row
    + Improve Czech translation
    + Enhance UI, refactor architecture, and improve data handling
    + Fix compact mode layout, hourly clipping, fix 100% CPU and memory growth
      on refresh, redesign the Cairo-drawn cards and several UI bugs
    + Feat: Smart Weather Overview, redesigned cards and forecast, plus
      stability fixes
    + Weather overview notifications, new preferences, better forecast and
      cards, GNOME 51
  * Updated translations.</comment>
    <requestid>1398617</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
